WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.511
Priorities become real when they receive time, attention, and review.

2
00:00:04.511 --> 00:00:09.549
A goal written in a document but never reflected on the calendar is mostly a wish.

3
00:00:09.549 --> 00:00:13.308
That does not mean every priority must become a rigid block.

4
00:00:13.308 --> 00:00:18.045
It means the system should show whether important work has a path to happen.

5
00:00:18.045 --> 00:00:24.662
If the calendar only contains meetings and urgent requests, it may not represent the actual priorities.

6
00:00:24.662 --> 00:00:33.985
Outcome goals describe the result: ship the project, improve a skill, reduce incidents, strengthen a relationship, or complete a certification.

7
00:00:33.985 --> 00:00:48.196
Process commitments describe the recurring behavior that makes the result more likely: two focused build sessions each week, a weekly review, thirty minutes of study, or a maintenance window that actually stays protected.

8
00:00:48.196 --> 00:00:49.850
Outcomes give direction.

9
00:00:49.850 --> 00:00:52.332
Process commitments create traction.

10
00:00:52.332 --> 00:00:56.016
Time horizons help balance the near term and the long term.

11
00:00:56.016 --> 00:00:58.948
Daily planning helps choose the next actions.

12
00:00:58.948 --> 00:01:02.181
Weekly planning exposes collisions and capacity.

13
00:01:02.181 --> 00:01:07.896
Monthly planning identifies larger commitments, travel, deadlines, and review points.

14
00:01:07.896 --> 00:01:13.911
Long-term planning asks whether current time use is compounding toward a future that matters.

15
00:01:13.911 --> 00:01:19.400
Without multiple horizons, the urgent present tends to consume the strategic future.

16
00:01:19.400 --> 00:01:23.309
High-leverage activities produce progress that compounds.

17
00:01:23.309 --> 00:01:38.798
They might include designing a reusable process, learning a core skill, fixing a recurring failure, improving documentation, mentoring someone, exercising judgment before work begins, or protecting a focused block for difficult creation.

18
00:01:38.798 --> 00:01:43.084
Productive motion can feel satisfying without changing outcomes.

19
00:01:43.084 --> 00:01:49.250
Meaningful progress moves the work, the capability, or the relationship in a durable direction.
